        <briefdescription>
<para>Note on EqualityComparable: </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The iterator is not re-entrant, it is meant to be used for parsing YAML on-demand Once iteration started - it can point only to one entry at a time hence Base.CurrentEntry and Other.Base.CurrentEntry are equal iff Base and Other.Base are equal. </para>
