    <briefdescription>
<para>This is an iterator abstraction over YAML collections shared by both sequences and maps. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>BaseT must have a ValueT* member named CurrentEntry and a member function increment() which must set CurrentEntry to 0 to create an end iterator. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
